{"seq":1,"slug":"mechanical-structure","title":"高一通用技术 — 机械结构","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/general-technology/tech-applications/mechanical-structure","wordCount":2060,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"高一通用技术-机械结构\">高一通用技术 — 机械结构</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>从自行车的链条传动到电梯的钢丝绳牵引，机械结构是人类历史上最古老也最广泛的技术形式。即便在电子技术高度发达的今天，几乎所有设备的最终动作——旋转、移动、夹持、提升——仍然由机械结构来完成。理解机械结构的基本原理，是通用技术学习的重要实践基础。</p>\n<p>机械结构的核心概念：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>实例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>机构</td>\n<td>能传递运动和力的构件组合</td>\n<td>曲柄连杆机构、凸轮机构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>构件</td>\n<td>机构中独立运动的单元</td>\n<td>齿轮、连杆、滑块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运动副</td>\n<td>两个构件之间的可动连接</td>\n<td>铰链（转动副）、滑槽（移动副）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>传动</td>\n<td>将运动和力从一处传递到另一处</td>\n<td>齿轮传动、皮带传动、链传动</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>机械结构的设计核心是解决两个问题：如何将输入的运动形式转化为需要的输出运动形式（运动变换），以及如何在传递过程中调节力和速度的大小（力的放大与缩小）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-基本运动形式与转换\">一、基本运动形式与转换</h3><p>物体的运动可以归结为三种基本形式：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>转动</strong>：绕固定轴的旋转运动（如车轮、电机轴）</li>\n<li><strong>直线运动（平动）</strong>：沿直线方向的移动（如抽屉、电梯）</li>\n<li><strong>摆动</strong>：绕固定点的往复旋转（如钟摆、雨刮器）</li>\n</ul>\n<p>机械设计中，常需要将一种运动形式转换为另一种：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[转动] -- 曲柄滑块 --&gt; B[直线运动]&#10;    A -- 曲柄摇杆 --&gt; C[摆动]&#10;    B -- 齿条齿轮 --&gt; A&#10;    C -- 棘轮机构 --&gt; A\">flowchart LR\n    A[转动] -- 曲柄滑块 --&gt; B[直线运动]\n    A -- 曲柄摇杆 --&gt; C[摆动]\n    B -- 齿条齿轮 --&gt; A\n    C -- 棘轮机构 --&gt; A</pre><p><strong>曲柄滑块机构</strong>：汽车发动机将活塞的直线运动（燃气膨胀推动活塞）转化为曲轴的旋转运动，再通过传动系统驱动车轮。反过来，缝纫机用曲柄滑块将电机的旋转转化为针杆的上下直线运动。</p>\n<p><strong>曲柄摇杆机构</strong>：汽车雨刮器将电机的旋转运动转化为刮片的扇形摆动。摆动角度由各连杆的长度比例决定。</p>\n<p><strong>凸轮机构</strong>：通过凸轮的特殊轮廓形状，可以实现几乎任意的运动规律。内燃机的配气机构用凸轮精确控制进排气门的开闭时机。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-常见传动方式\">二、常见传动方式</h3><p>传动的目的是将动力源的运动和力传递到工作部件，同时可能需要改变转速、转向或运动形式。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>传动方式</th>\n<th>传动比精确度</th>\n<th>传递距离</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>齿轮传动</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>短</td>\n<td>效率高、传动比稳定</td>\n<td>噪声较大、需润滑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>皮带传动</td>\n<td>近似</td>\n<td>较长</td>\n<td>缓冲减振、过载保护</td>\n<td>有滑动、寿命较短</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>链传动</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>中等</td>\n<td>无滑动、适应性好</td>\n<td>噪声大、速度不宜过高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>蜗轮蜗杆</td>\n<td>精确</td>\n<td>短</td>\n<td>大传动比、自锁</td>\n<td>效率低、发热多</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>齿轮传动深入</strong>：</p>\n<p>两个啮合齿轮的传动比为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i = \\frac{n_1}{n_2} = \\frac{z_2}{z_1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.044em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 为转速，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">z</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.044em;\">z</span></span></span></span></span> 为齿数。例如主动轮 20 齿，从动轮 60 齿，传动比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>20</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i = 60/20 = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60/20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>，即从动轮转速是主动轮的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/3</span></span></span></span></span>，但扭矩放大了 3 倍。</p>\n<p>自行车通过更换不同齿数的后链轮来实现变速：上坡时用大后轮（传动比大，省力但慢），平路时用小后轮（传动比小，费力但快）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-简单机械与力的放大\">三、简单机械与力的放大</h3><p>几种经典的简单机械原理在现代结构中依然广泛应用：</p>\n<p><strong>杠杆原理</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>F</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F_1 \\times L_1 = F_2 \\times L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>省力杠杆（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1 &gt; L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）：撬棒、开瓶器、独轮车</li>\n<li>费力杠杆（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1 &lt; L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）：镊子、钓鱼竿、筷子（换取运动幅度）</li>\n<li>等臂杠杆（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L_1 = L_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）：天平</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>斜面原理</strong>：将物体沿斜面推上高处，所需力小于直接举升，但移动距离更长。螺丝钉就是卷绕的斜面——每转一圈前进一个螺距，将旋转力转化为强大的轴向压紧力。</p>\n<p><strong>滑轮组</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 段绳子承担重物，每段绳子分担 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的重力，但需要拉动 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 倍长度的绳子。</p>\n<h3 id=\"四-结构强度与稳定性\">四、结构强度与稳定性</h3><p>机械结构不仅要能运动，还要承受各种力而不损坏。</p>\n<p><strong>应力的概念</strong>：应力 = 力 / 面积（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>F</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma = F / A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>），单位为帕斯卡（Pa）。同样大小的力，作用面积越小，应力越大——这就是为什么高跟鞋会在软地面留下深坑，而平底鞋不会。</p>\n<p><strong>常见结构形式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>桁架结构</strong>：由三角形单元组成，轻量且强度高。桥梁、输电塔广泛采用</li>\n<li><strong>框架结构</strong>：由梁和柱组成的骨架，内部空间大。建筑物主要采用</li>\n<li><strong>壳体结构</strong>：利用曲面的刚度承载。鸡蛋、飞机机身、安全帽</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>提高结构强度的方法</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>增加截面积（用更粗的杆件）</li>\n<li>改变截面形状（工字形截面抗弯能力远强于同面积的方形截面）</li>\n<li>添加加强筋（瓦楞纸板的波浪结构就是加强筋原理）</li>\n<li>改善受力方式（将弯曲力转化为拉压力）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"五-实际案例分析\">五、实际案例分析</h3><p><strong>自行车传动系统</strong>：</p>\n<p>脚踏板（输入力）→ 曲柄（转动）→ 链轮（链传动）→ 后轮花鼓 → 车轮转动。变速器通过拨链器在不同齿数的链轮间切换，改变传动比。</p>\n<p><strong>剪刀的力学分析</strong>：</p>\n<p>剪刀是两根交叉杠杆的组合。手握把手施力，通过支点（铰接处）放大后作用在刃口。刃口距支点越近的位置剪切力越大——所以剪厚纸板时要用靠近铰接处的刃根部分。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>观察自行车的变速系统，数一数前后链轮的齿数。计算前链轮 48 齿搭配后链轮 16 齿和后链轮 32 齿时的传动比，并说明哪种组合适合上坡，哪种适合平路骑行。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>设计一个简单的机构，将电机的旋转运动转化为滑动门的直线往复运动。画出机构简图，标注各构件名称。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>用纸板制作一个桁架桥模型（跨度 30cm），与同样材料制作的平板桥进行承重对比实验。记录两者的承载能力差异，分析桁架结构为什么更强。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>找出生活中分别运用省力杠杆、费力杠杆和等臂杠杆的各两个实例，分析每个实例中牺牲了什么来换取了什么。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>螺丝钉为什么能产生很大的夹紧力？如果螺距从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1mm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span></span></span></span></span> 变为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.5</mn><mi>m</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.5mm</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.5</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">mm</span></span></span></span></span>，夹紧力会如何变化？扭转螺丝所需的圈数会如何变化？</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><p>机械结构的历史可以追溯到远古时代。古埃及人用斜面和杠杆建造金字塔，中国古代用水车和翻车灌溉农田，达芬奇设计了令人惊叹的连杆机构和飞行器草图。工业革命后，蒸汽机的曲柄连杆机构将热能第一次大规模转化为机械动能，彻底改变了人类文明的进程。</p>\n<p>推荐探索的方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>乐高技术系列</strong>用齿轮、连杆、凸轮等机械元件构建各种有趣的机构，是理解机械原理的绝佳动手平台</li>\n<li><strong>鲁布·戈德堡机械</strong>（Rube Goldberg Machine）是一种故意设计得极其复杂的连锁机构，用来完成简单任务——在趣味中深刻理解运动传递</li>\n<li>关注<strong>仿生机械</strong>领域：波士顿动力的机器人模仿动物的关节和肌肉结构，实现了令人震撼的运动能力</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>机械结构通过构件和运动副的组合，实现运动形式的转换和力的传递。齿轮、皮带、链条是三种基本传动方式，各有优劣。杠杆、斜面、滑轮等简单机械原理是力的放大与缩小的基础。结构设计需要综合考虑强度、稳定性和轻量化的平衡。下一节将进入电子电路的世界，学习另一种形式的信号传递与控制。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高一通用技术 — 机械结构","id":"高一通用技术-机械结构"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一、基本运动形式与转换","id":"一-基本运动形式与转换"},{"level":3,"text":"二、常见传动方式","id":"二-常见传动方式"},{"level":3,"text":"三、简单机械与力的放大","id":"三-简单机械与力的放大"},{"level":3,"text":"四、结构强度与稳定性","id":"四-结构强度与稳定性"},{"level":3,"text":"五、实际案例分析","id":"五-实际案例分析"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"高一通用技术 — 反馈系统","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/general-technology/systems-control/feedback-systems"},"next":{"title":"高一通用技术 — 电子电路","url":"/l-doc-books/education/high-school/year-1/general-technology/tech-applications/electronic-circuits"}}